The '''Lumber Jack''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Foraging Camp}} in the {{zone|Forest}}. They ask the player to collect {{Item|Oak Log|amount=20}}s. In return for the logs, they give the player a {{Item|Promising Axe}}.

